The RP2350-Matrix_ is a :bbl:`special sized` RP2350 development board.
The on-board USB-C connector makes it compatible to future standards.
It comes with an on-board 8×8 RGB LED matrix for colorful lighting
displays or simple images.

.. list-table::
   :align: center
   :width: 100%
   :widths: 66, 33

   * - .. rubric:: Features and Resources
     - .. rubric:: Printed Circuit Board

   * - :hwftlbl-vdd:`5V/480㎃`
       :hwftlbl-vdd:`3.3V/800㎃`
